{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1022668-shady-deals-political-plots-conspiracy-for-dummies","id":1022668,"title":"Shady Deals/Political Plots/Conspiracy for dummies","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-27T02:59:52-08:00","id":1022668,"title":"Shady Deals/Political Plots/Conspiracy for dummies","content":"Not very good at plotting Political/Conspuracy/Shady-Deal Stories, so Starting A Thread that will hopefully help with plots involving Shadow Lords and Silver Fangs<br /> <br /> <b>Today's Conspiracy: Lavafang the Dragon</b><br /> <br /> &quot;Good Day, Baron (Rival &amp; Enemy to my comparatively weak Alpha), Steven &quot;Wyrm Cleaver&quot; O'Gradey, Dragonslayer Esquire of the Shadow Lords Tribe at your service.<br /> <br /> I am aware that your daughter needs to be rescued from LavaFang the dragon, but you can neither afford the public embarrassment of failing to protect your child NOR the 10 Million Dollars absent from your constantly embezzled treasury.<br /> <br /> Oh do stop crying: It would be most un-professional for a Famous Dragon Slayer to leave a helpless damsel to be consumed by my professional enemy now, wouldn't it? But I DO have to Eat and put a roof over my head.<br /> <br /> So tell you what: I will rescue your precious little girl for a paltry Five Hundred Thousand Dollars of formality; and instead of the Nine Point Five Million Dollars that you WOULD Have had to pay with a greedier mercenary, you must instead: <br /> <br /> Supply My Liege with the Heavy Cavalry His Sept Lacks in the battle with the Formori Horde allied with Unseelie and Black Spirals at Dagger Pass Woods next week.<br /> <br /> AND<br /> <br /> Endorse My Liege's Election at Next Month's Grand Moot with your Illustrious Vote, which he cannot himself supply not being of Noble Birth Himself.<br /> <br /> Yes? Why all I need now is your ring pressed here in this here melted wax seal of approval! Come on now, don't be shy.<br /> <br /> There! Deal Sealed! And as a bonus My Liege and I won't tell The World that Your Little Lady's Tragic Kidnapping could have been *easily* avoided if you did not NEGLECT TO PAY THE TITHE YOU OWE LAVAFANG THE DRAGON in favor of spending it on outrageous parties.<br /> <br /> Oh your welcome, what are friends for? \ud83d\ude42 (Pats Shoulder of &quot;new best friend&quot; and Vanishes into shadow)<br /> <br /> How's that for a cloaks and daggers deal? \ud83d\ude1b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4684,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4684-lin-liren","user":"Lin Liren","date":". 12-27-2016, 06:14 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4684-lin-liren","name":"Lin Liren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-27T17:22:49-08:00","id":1023040,"title":"","content":"This is how I run political plots:<br /> <br /> 1. Everyone has a price. For an honest judge his price may be the lives of his children, but everyone can be bought. <br /> 2. Everyone/everything has a use. You should go into a situation with the idea of how can I use this person/situation. <br /> 3. There is no such thing as failure. You just haven't figured out how to turn the situation to your advantage yet. <br /> 4. Everyone has a weakness. Everyone has a secret. All your npc's should have a weakness for your players to exploit. Maybe your cop ally likes to believe he is a good guy despite the fact he is feeding the PCs information. <br /> <br /> Just be sure to give your PCs handles to move your NPCs around with. And make sure your PCs have handles for your NPCs to move them around with. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-27T21:28:19-08:00","id":1023098,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1022668-shady-deals-political-plots-conspiracy-for-dummies?p=1023040#post1023040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">3. There is no such thing as failure. You just haven't figured out how to turn the situation to your advantage yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>On that point: Even though it's not shown onscreen, how would Emperor Sheeve Palpatine have turned the disaster that was the Destruction of the First Death Star to his advantage, for example? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> It took <i>twenty</i> years and <i>trillions</i> of credits to build, notwithstanding it was a humiliating demonstration of how The Emperor is <i>not</i> all powerful; how would this master manipulator have 